Categories:
  - Connectivity
License: GPL-3.0-or-later
AuthorName: hurricane
AutoName: L-Shell Orbit
Summary: Monitor compatible Starlink terminals locally
Description: |-
  L-Shell Orbit monitors and diagnoses compatible Starlink terminals and routers
  through their local gRPC interfaces. It does not require a Starlink account,
  Google Play Services, analytics or advertising. Metrics and reports are kept
  locally. Public CelesTrak orbital data is used only by the optional AR view.

  L-Shell Orbit is an independent, unofficial project and is not affiliated
  with or endorsed by Starlink or SpaceX.

RepoType: git
Repo: https://github.com/strongsand/L-Shell-Orbit.git
SourceCode: https://github.com/strongsand/L-Shell-Orbit
IssueTracker: https://github.com/strongsand/L-Shell-Orbit/issues

# The commit value is the future release tag. Keep this draft out of fdroiddata
# until that tag exists in the public repository.
Builds:
